Z||000000||Nashco||11-29-2001||03:37 AM||||I just hit over 1000 posts and didn't even realize I was coming up on it!  Wow, it's amazing at how much I post now compared to what I did at first.  Now that I'm comfortable with all of you guys (and gals) and I have some knowledge on the fiero...it appears I'm a post-addict.  I know there are others that have posted MUCH more than me in a shorter time period, but this is a big deal for me...I catch myself needing to check the forum at work now! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><P>It's been a great first 1000 posts everybody, I thank you for being so helpful, friendly, and all around cool <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I'm glad to have found a group of friends I can have all year long, even though I move every three months! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ok, enough of this cheesy "Look at me, I talk too much, and I love you all" post...lol!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||10
